# Sentinel Regulatory & Technical Operations — Custom Domain Setup (EUR 0.00 GitHub Pages / Cloudflare)
#
# DO NOT rename this file directly to `docs/CNAME` until your custom domain DNS records are configured.
#
# Zero-Cost Binding Workflow:
# 1. Point an apex domain or subdomain (e.g., `sentinel-regulatory.eu` or `audit.your-domain.fr`)
#    to GitHub Pages (`kaledbouchagraoui7-bot.github.io`) via Cloudflare Free DNS (CNAME or A records
#    `185.199.108.153` .. `185.199.111.153`).
# 2. Run the automated configurator to update `client_ops_config.json`, rebuild `docs/` + `site_deploy_ready/`,
#    and enable the clean domain across outreach emails and 300-DPI scorecards:
#
#      python client_ops_automation.py set-custom-domain --domain sentinel-regulatory.eu
#
# 3. Copy or write your chosen domain into `docs/CNAME` and push to GitHub Pages `main`.
#
sentinel-regulatory.example.eu
